        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Colorless single-crystal blocks of 1–3 were obtained by reaction of p-tert-butylcalix[4]arene (0.065 g, 0.1 mmol), Ln(NO3)3·6H2O (0.068 g, ca. 0.15 mmol; Ln = Gd for 1), N(CH2CH3)3 (1 mL), DMF (5 mL), and CH3OH (5 mL) in a 20 mL Teflon-lined autoclave at 130 °C for 3 days, then slow cooling to 20 °C at about 4 °C/h. Crystals were isolated by filtration and washed with 1:1 DMF–CH3OH. Yield ca. 30% for 1 based on H4C4A.",
